        "passage": "Watch a National Soccer Game at Green Stadium!\n\nIf you are a soccer fan, don’t miss the exciting national soccer game next weekend at Green Stadium. You can also go to some special places near the stadium before or after the game. Let’s cheer for our favorite team!\n\nPeople with the Purple Pass can take a photo with soccer players after the game.\n\nThere are several interesting places around Green Stadium. At Prize Ground, you can find souvenirs like caps, T-shirts and toys. Kick Café is a good place for a quick coffee or being with friends. You can also visit the Fan Museum to learn about the history of famous soccer teams and the experiences of some players.\n\n字詞：stadium 體育場；souvenir 紀念品。",
